 killed or  paralyzed in the back of those vans just  in recent history but no command members  Kevin Davis doesn't pay a price the  mayor doesn't pay a price nobody has  anything happened to them other than the  individual officer at the bottom who was  really just a pawn all along we've been  speaking with Michael Wood jr. he is a  former Baltimore Police Commander you  can follow him on Twitter at Michael a  Wood jr. and also check out civilian-led  policing dot org Michael always great to  talk to you yeah thanks for having me  David thanks for throwing in those  pictures there we definitely need people  to go to veterans stand and civilian  life policing that is the way you guys  can take something in your own hands and  do something in your community

